                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A \"Walking Simulator\" intended to help people that are afraid of heights to get over they fear.\n\nThe graphics are very nice, the environment is relaxing and actually quite beautiful. The Koi pond was specially nice.\n\nThere are a series of bridges you can cross all withing 1 \"Zen Garden\" map, each bridge is higher than the previous one, so you can go at your own pace, with the last one going across a huge cliff.\n\nWhile simple and not having much to do other than explore and walk around, this experience was relaxing and enjoyable, Recommended for anyone looking for something like this..",
